ion at $10.50, sold on Shopee.\n- **Lazada blog posts:** These are generic guides about whitening deodorants, not Scion. One says comments like \"I saw a slight difference after 6 weeks of daily use\" are more credible than \"It worked overnight!\"\n\nOverall, the evidence points to a few weeks to about two months of daily use for visible change, with a 6–8 week figure cited by the roundup. That is a rough picture, not a verified result. I found no independent test of Scion specifically. Shopee's own review section or a fuller review would be needed for more detail.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c9f62a-b8d7-4f1b-9daf-d55be40f8038","uuid":"ce892aeb-fd11-4f18-a1dd-e0d62b645648","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:23:46.279Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Scion roll on Shopee review whitening underarm results weeks","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AxLyzEdp7YQd75TXJYjF5B","content":[{"title":"Nu Skin Scion Whitening Roll-On Deodorant - Beauty Review","url":"https://reviews.femaledaily.com/products/grooming/deodorants/Nu-Skin/scion-whitening-roll-on-deodorant"},{"title":"skinever underarm whitening cream","url":"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/skinever-underarm-whitening-cream/"},{"title":"15 Best Whitening Deodorants In Singapore That Actually Work Wonders","url":"https://beautyinsider.sg/?p=84709"},{"title":"www.lazada.com.ph","url":"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/?p=16358"},{"title":"belo deodorant underarm whitening","url":"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/belo-deodorant-underarm-whitening/"},{"title":"lavojoy deodorant whitening effectiveness","url":"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/lavojoy-deodorant-whitening-effectiveness/"},{"title":"• categories","url":"https://www.nykaa.com/cos-iq-brightening-underarm-roll-on-serum-for-women/reviews/19809545"},{"title":"MY MUST HAVE FOR SHOOTS; UNDERARM BRIGHTENING ๐Ÿ”†","url":"https://www.lemon8-app.com/@natellalee/7