{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LiwsmzkDBEiUC5LYrpR6ws","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Scion\" Nu Skin roll on \"Glycyrrhiza\" OR \"licorice\" OR \"arbutin\" OR \"alum\" ingredients brightening\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Scion NU Skin Deodorant Brightening Roll On Ship From USA Free Shipping\",\"url\":\"https://www.ebay.com/itm/364545344994\"},{\"title\":\"NU SKIN Scion™ Brightening Roll-on Deodorant\",\"url\":\"https://berryboutique.co.nz/product/nuskinscionbrighteningroll-ondeodorant/\"},{\"title\":\"Scion Brightening Roll-On - 75ml (New Formula and Packaging)\",\"url\":\"https://naturallybaby.ph/products/scion-whitening-roll-on-deodorant-and-anti-perspirant-24-hr-protection\"},{\"title\":\"Scion Brightening Roll On\",\"url\":\"https://www.theskinrx.co.uk/product-page/acne-solution-kit\"},{\"title\":\"Scion® Brightening Roll-on Deodorant (New Zealand)\",\"url\":\"https://nubestskin.com/nz/product/scion-brightening-roll-on-deodorant/\"},{\"title\":\"Scion® Brightening Roll On Deodorant\",\"url\":\"https://nuskin.com/catalog/au/en/product/scion-brightening-roll-on-deodorant\"},{\"title\":\"1 NU SKIN® PRODUCT INFORMATION PAGE MEET SCIÓN BRIGHTENING ROLL-ON DEODORANT\",\"url\":\"https://www.nuskin.com/content/dam/office/pacific_new/shared/en/pips/total-care/ScionBrighteningDeodorantPIP.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Scion Brightening Roll-on\",\"url\":\"https://www.nuskin.com/catalog/ph/en/product/24004368\"},{\"title\":\"Scion® Brightening Roll-on Deodorant Bulk 36pk\",\"url\":\"https://www.nuskin.com/au/en/product/scion-brightening-roll-on-deodorant-bulk-36pk-AU\"},{\"title\":\"Scion Brightening Roll-on 50PV\",\"url\":\"https://www.nuskin.com/catalog/ph/en/product/24127545\"}]\n\nThe search confirms that Nu Skin's Scion Brightening Roll-On uses licorice, but the listings don't agree on the full set of actives.\n\n- **Licorice:** Nu Skin's official product page lists a licorice root extract (Glycyrrhiza glabra) as a brightening ingredient, and the Philippines listing describes it as helping reduce hyperpigmentation. Some listings call it \"liquorice.\"\n- **Bearberry and arbutin:** Official pages name bearberry extract as the natural lightening agent. Nu Skin's older product information sheet ties bearberry to arbutin, which is the compound in bearberry leaves that does the lightening. Listings also pair the bearberry extract with niacinamide.\n- **Alum:** None of the results list alum. The antiperspirant is aluminum chlorohydrate, which is a different compound. Listings note it works by reducing sweat, not by brightening.\n- **Other actives:** Several listings include lactic acid (an AHA) and allantoin, which are not brightening agents as such.\n- **Formula variation:** Ingredient lists differ by region and by batch. The New Zealand listing says it uses bearberry and licorice without the longan or other brightening pairs found in other Scion products. The Nu Skin product sheet for the Australian bulk pack lists bearberry and licorice. Check the label on the product you have.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c9f62a-b8d7-4f1b-9daf-d55be40f8038","uuid":"aa3dc29f-8efc-4bd2-b57b-f7c38c23e21b","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:23:55.707Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"Scion\" Nu Skin roll on \"Glycyrrhiza\" OR \"licorice\" OR \"arbutin\" OR \"alum\" ingredients brightening","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01BV1KoA8pHPgdpK3NgCsuTg","content":[{"title":"Scion NU Skin Deodorant Brightening Roll On Ship From USA Free Shipping","url":"https://www.ebay.com/itm/364545344994"},{"title":"NU SKIN Scion™ Brightening Roll-on Deodorant","url":"https://berryboutique.co.nz/product/nuskinscionbrighteningroll-ondeodorant/"},{"title":"Scion Brightening Roll-On - 75ml (New Formula and Packaging)","url":"https://naturallybaby.ph/products/scion-whitening-roll-on-deodorant-and-anti-perspirant-24-hr-protection"},{"title":"Scion Brightening Roll On","url":"https://www.theskinrx.co.uk/product-page/acne-solution-kit"},{"title":"Scion® Brightening Roll-on Deodorant (New Zealand)","url":"https://nubestskin.com/nz/product/scion-brightening-roll-on-deodorant/"},{"title":"Scion® Brightening Roll On Deodorant","url":"https://nuskin.com/catalog/au/en/product/scion-brightening-roll-on-deodorant"},{"title":"1 NU SKIN® PRODUCT INFORMATION PAGE MEET SCIÓN BRIGHTENING ROLL-ON DEODORANT","url":"https://www.nuskin.com/content/dam/office/pacific_new/shared/en/pips/total-care/ScionBrighteningDeodorantPIP.pdf"},{"title":"Scion Brightening Roll-on","url":"https://www.nuskin.com/catalog/ph/en/product/24004368"},{"title":"Scion® Brightening Roll-on Deodorant Bulk 36pk","url":"https://www.nuskin.com/au/en/product/scion-brightening-roll-on-deodorant-bulk-36pk-AU"},{"title":"Scion Brightening Roll-on 50PV","url":"https://www.nuskin.com/catalog/ph/en/product/24127545"}]},"The search confirms that Nu Skin's Scion Brightening Roll-On uses licorice, but the listings don't agree on the full set of actives.\n\n- **Licorice:** Nu Skin's official product page lists a licorice root extract (Glycyrrhiza glabra) as a brightening ingredient, and the Philippines listing describes it as helping reduce hyperpigmentation. Some listings call it \"liquorice.\"\n- **Bearberry and arbutin:** Official pages name bearberry extract as the natural lightening agent. Nu Skin's older product information sheet ties bearberry to arbutin, which is the compound in bearberry leaves that does the lightening. Listings also pair the bearberry extract with niacinamide.\n- **Alum:** None of the results list alum. The antiperspirant is aluminum chlorohydrate, which is a different compound. Listings note it works by reducing sweat, not by brightening.\n- **Other actives:** Several listings include lactic acid (an AHA) and allantoin, which are not brightening agents as such.\n- **Formula variation:** Ingredient lists differ by region and by batch. The New Zealand listing says it uses bearberry and licorice without the longan or other brightening pairs found in other Scion products. The Nu Skin product sheet for the Australian bulk pack lists bearberry and licorice. Check the label on the product you have."],"durationSeconds":5.957534333,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LiwsmzkDBEiUC5LYrpR6ws","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
