ntenido\",\"url\":\"https://listado.mercadolibre.com.co/desodorante-neutro\"},{\"title\":\"Arden for men\",\"url\":\"https://www.farmatodo.com.co/producto/208100035-desodorante-arden-for\"},{\"title\":\"265550112 desodorante nivea clinical tono natural roll on x 50 ml\",\"url\":\"https://www.farmatodo.com.co/producto/265550112-desodorante-nivea-clinical-tono-natural-roll-on-x-50-ml\"},{\"title\":\"Desodorante Dove tono uniforme orquídeas en roll on\",\"url\":\"https://www.dove.com/co/p/dermo-aclarant-roll-on.html/00000075077341\"},{\"title\":\"Desodorantes Roll-on Esika Y Cyzone para hombre y mujer\",\"url\":\"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/shorts/clips/W3WCmZ/desodorantes-roll-on-esika-cyzone\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up any official Nu Skin Colombia listing for the Scion roll-on. The results are mostly third-party sellers and unrelated Colombian deodorant brands.\n\n- **Scion Whitening Roll-On:** An eBay listing offers it as a whitening underarm anti-perspirant, priced at US$36.49 each, with bulk discounts for four or more. It's listed as new, but the page doesn't say where the seller is based or whether it ships to Colombia. (3x Nu Skin SCION Whitening Roll-On DeoDorant UnderArm Anti-Perspirant FREE SHIP! US $36.49/ea Condition: New)\n- **Review page:** A Female Daily page for the same product lists a rating of 4.5 from 678 users, with a price shown in Indonesian rupiah (Rp 90,000), not Colombian pesos. (Rp. 90.000 4.5 444 171 48 12 3 678 users)\n- **Colombian market:** Results from Falabella, Farmatodo, Locatel, and Mercado Libre Colombia cover Perspirex, Yanbal, Vichy, Nivea, and other roll-ons, but none mention Nu Skin or Scion.\n\nFor Colombian availability or pricing, the next step would be to check Nu Skin's Colombian website or a Nu Skin distributor directly, since no official source came up here.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c9f6