dorante-neutro"},{"title":"Arden for men","url":"https://www.farmatodo.com.co/producto/208100035-desodorante-arden-for"},{"title":"265550112 desodorante nivea clinical tono natural roll on x 50 ml","url":"https://www.farmatodo.com.co/producto/265550112-desodorante-nivea-clinical-tono-natural-roll-on-x-50-ml"},{"title":"Desodorante Dove tono uniforme orquídeas en roll on","url":"https://www.dove.com/co/p/dermo-aclarant-roll-on.html/00000075077341"},{"title":"Desodorantes Roll-on Esika Y Cyzone para hombre y mujer","url":"https://www.mercadolibre.com.co/shorts/clips/W3WCmZ/desodorantes-roll-on-esika-cyzone"}]},"The search didn't turn up any official Nu Skin Colombia listing for the Scion roll-on. The results are mostly third-party sellers and unrelated Colombian deodorant brands.\n\n- **Scion Whitening Roll-On:** An eBay listing offers it as a whitening underarm anti-perspirant, priced at US$36.49 each, with bulk discounts for four or more. It's listed as new, but the page doesn't say where the seller is based or whether it ships to Colombia. (3x Nu Skin SCION Whitening Roll-On DeoDorant UnderArm Anti-Perspirant FREE SHIP! US $36.49/ea Condition: New)\n- **Review page:** A Female Daily page for the same product lists a rating of 4.5 from 678 users, with a price shown in Indonesian rupiah (Rp 90,000), not Colombian pesos. (Rp. 90.000 4.5 444 171 48 12 3 678 users)\n- **Colombian market:** Results from Falabella, Farmatodo, Locatel, and Mercado Libre Colombia cover Perspirex, Yanbal, Vichy, Nivea, and other roll-ons, but none mention Nu Skin or Scion.\n\nFor Colombian availability or pricing, the next step would be to check Nu Skin's Colombian website or a Nu Skin distributor directly, since no official source came up here."],"durationSeconds":5.908929124999995,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CvRZ81jtK1Gyoj2p1sN1W9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K3CvqrjDAB3DyurD6J4SG7","type":"tool_result","content":"**Scion® Brightening Roll-On Deodorant (Nu Skin, Australia)**\n\n- **Price:** A$16.00 (retail)\n- **Size:** 75 ml\n- **SKU:** 07004368\n- **Shipping:** Free on orders over $99\n\n**Claims**\n- Brightens the underarm, with visible results in as little as 4 weeks of daily use\n- Controls underarm sweating and odour\n- Alcohol-free formula\n- Dermatologist-tested, hypoallergenic, and described as clinically proven\n- Suitable for sensitive skin and daily use\n- Gender-neutral for men and women\n- Does not leave yellow stains on clothing (per the FAQ)\n- Quick-absorbing, with no sticky or greasy residue\n- Cruelty-free, not tested on animals\n\n**Key ingredients**\n- Niacinamide: brightening and evening skin tone\n- Bearberry extract: natural skin-lightening agent\n- Liquorice extract: reduces hyperpigmentation\n- Aluminum chlorohydrate: antiperspirant\n- Lactic acid (AHA): exfoliates and helps with texture and clogged pores\n- Allantoin: soothes irritated skin\n\nOther listed ingredients include water, steareth-2, steareth-21, fragrance, isopropyl palmitate, pentylene glycol, glycerin, and butylene glycol, among others.\n\n**How to use**\n- Apply to the entire underarm after a bath or shower.\n- The FAQ says it can be applied after shaving, but it's best to wait a few minutes first.\n\n**Warnings and recommendations**\n- Keep out of reach of children.\n- Close the bottle cap tightly after each use.\n\n**Ratings/reviews:** None appear in the captured page content. The page was truncated, so reviews may exist elsewhere on the site."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c9f62a-b8d7-4f1b-9daf-d55be40f8038","uuid":"e8f6f026-d54e-42c4-ba77-5bbf4ea62c05","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:24:10.857Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1469113,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Scion® Brightening Roll-On Deodorant (Nu Skin, Australia)**\n\n- **Price:**