o del propio Invima describe el sistema como una obligación para el comercializador de obtener esa notificación ante la autoridad, con base en la Decisión 516 de la Comunidad Andina (Decisión 516 de 2002 de la Comunidad Andina).\n\n**Caso del desodorante:** La Alerta Sanitaria 226-2026 se emitió contra el \"Desodorante Natural Marca Alufresh\", publicada el 15 de julio de 2026 (Publicada el 15-07-2026). Según la alerta, el producto se vendía por redes sociales y el Invima lo clasificó como fraudulento por no tener NSO (El producto no cuenta con la Notificación Sanitaria Obligatoria (NSO) requerida, por lo cual es clasificado como un producto fraudulento.). Este caso ilustra que un \"desodorante natural\" sin NSO puede ser objeto de alerta, pero no detalla qué claims están prohibidos.\n\n**Lo que no encontré:** Ningún resultado trata sobre claims de blanqueamiento, despigmentación ni restricciones publicitarias específicas para desodorantes. Hubo una alerta sobre productos despigmentantes vendidos ilegalmente en redes sociales, pero el extracto disponible no detalla los claims prohibidos. Para eso habría que revisar la normativa andina vigente (Decisión 516 modificada por la Decisión 777) y las listas de sustancias prohibidas o restringidas del Invima."],"durationSeconds":6.347321959000001,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015tbYmsgtmYrXXZqzrpHe2h","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dz1M6D5vdySbbkqq1MR7vv","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"reddit dark armpits deodorant brightening \"didn't work\" OR \"finally\" shaving friction\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"So THAT'S Why Your Armpits Look Dark After Shaving\",\"url\":\"https://huffingtonpost.co.uk/entry/so-thats-why-your-armpits-look-dark-after-shaving_uk_6706435ce4b006047915ce5c\"},{\"title\":\"UNDERSTANDING ARMPIT DISCOLORATION AND DARKENING\",\"url\":\"https://www.dove.com/us/en/stories/tips-and-how-to/grooming-tips/armpit-discoloration.html\"},{\"title\":\"Armpit discoloration and darkening: Causes and solutions\",\"url\":\"https://stacker.com/stories/beauty-grooming/armpit-discoloration-and-darkening-causes-and-solutions\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get Rid of Dark Underarms in 3 Steps\",\"url\":\"https://www.trulybeauty.com/blogs/body/how-to-get-rid-of-dark-underarms\"},{\"title\":\"Underarm Brightening: The Dos and Don’ts of Taking Care of Your Armpits\",\"url\":\"https://allthingsbeauty.com/en-ph/skin/underarm-care/dos-and-donts-of-underarm-brightening\"},{\"title\":\"What Causes Dark Underarms—and How to Get Rid of It, According to Derms\",\"url\":\"https://news.yahoo.com/causes-dark-underarms-rid-according-194458372.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.lazada.com.ph\",\"url\":\"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/?p=16358\"},{\"title\":\"what causes darker armpits\",\"url\":\"https://www.newbeauty.com/view/what-causes-darker-armpits\"},{\"title\":\"the truth about underarm dark spots\",\"url\":\"https://www.rexona.com/ph/sweat-zone/the-truth-about-underarm-dark-spots.html\"},{\"title\":\"the reason why your armpits look dark even if you shave regularly\",\"url\":\"https://www.newbeauty.com/view/the-reason-why-your-armpits-look-dark-even-if-you-shave-regularly\"},{\"title\":\"medicube deodorant underarm fix\",\"url\":\"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/medicube-deodorant-underarm-fix/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Get Rid of Dark Armpits, from Skin Science Experts\",\"url\":\"https://thehealthy.com/beauty/face-body-care/how-to-get-rid-of-dark-armpits-from-renowned-skin-experts\"},{\"title\":\"How I’m Brightening My Dark Armpits\",\"url\":\"https://www.trulybeauty.com/blogs/body/how-i-m-brightening-my-dark-armpits\"},{\"title\":\"DARK ARMPITS? HERE’S WHAT CAUSES THEM AND WHAT TO DO ABOUT IT\",\"url\":\"https://www.degreedeodorant.com/us/en/sweat-zone/causes-of-dark-underarms.html\"},{\"title\":\"Lemon8Lifestyle community\",\"url\":\"https://www.lemon8-app.com/experience/deodorant-recommendation-dark-armpits?region=us\"}]\n\nI didn't find any Reddit threads in these results, so this covers the general advice that dermatology and beauty sites give on the topic. I searched once.\n\n- **Shaving is a common cause.** One dermatology-focused article notes that razor friction and micro-cuts can trigger post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation. Another says dermatologists generally consider shaving can be the most irritating method of hair removal.\n- **Lubrication and fresh blades help.** One dermatologist advises never shaving on bare skin and always using a lubricant like a shaving gel. Another suggests avoiding dull, old blades and wetting the area first.\n- **Brightening deodorants are one option.** Products cited include a deodorant with niacinamide and mandelic acid, and a cream that fades dark spots, soothes irritation from shaving, and blocks body odor. Ingredient-wise, underarm brightening creams with ingredients like niacinamide, kojic acid or vitamin C can help lighten dark spots and even out the skin tone.\n- **Results take time.** One source says a 2015 study found salicylic acid highly effective at reducing the appearance of dark patches when used consistently over 2-3 months. A brightening deodorant review says its product is designed to work gradually, yielding visible brightening over several weeks.\n- **Some causes aren't avoidable.** One dermatologist notes that in many cases, dark armpits are hereditary and can't be avoided, though reducing shaving irritation still lowers the risk.\n\nMost of these sources are brand-affiliated, so the product claims in particular deserve skepticism. If you want the user-experience angle you searched for, a Reddit-specific query (for example, naming r/SkincareAddiction or r/AsianBeauty) may turn up threads.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"68c9f62a-b8d7-4f1b-9daf-d55be40f8038","uuid":"3856ae53-7d49-4f54-aa2a-0d7c0b559069","timestamp":"2026-11-28T11:24:22.421Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"reddit dark armpits deodorant brightening \"didn't work\" OR \"finally\" shaving friction","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01DP5wZEEhhRHwPfRcuDfXKt","content":[{"title":"So THAT'S Why Your Armpits Look Dark After Shaving","url":"https://huffingtonpost.co.uk/entry/so-thats-why-your-armpits-look-dark-after-shaving_uk_6706435ce4b006047915ce5c"},{"title":"UNDERSTANDING ARMPIT DISCOLORATION AND DARKENING","url":"https://www.dove.com/us/en/stories/tips-and-how-to/grooming-tips/armpit-discoloration.html"},{"title":"Armpit discoloration and darkening: Causes and solutions","url":"https://stacker.com/stories/beauty-grooming/armpit-discoloration-and-darkening-causes-and-solutions"},{"title":"How to Get Rid of Dark Underarms in 3 Steps","url":"https://www.trulybeauty.com/blogs/body/how-to-get-rid-of-dark-underarms"},{"title":"Underarm Brightening: The Dos and Don’ts of Taking Care of Your Armpits","url":"https://allthingsbeauty.com/en-ph/skin/underarm-care/dos-and-donts-of-underarm-brightening"},{"title":"What Causes Dark Underarms—and How to Get Rid of It, According to Derms","url":"https://news.yahoo.com/causes-dark-underarms-rid-according-194458372.html"},{"title":"www.lazada.com.ph","url":"https://www.lazada.com.ph/blog/?p=16358"},{"title":"what causes darker armpits","url":"https://www.newbeauty.com/view/w